                  "title": "Colombian “onces”",
                  "float": false,
                  "text": "In the middle of the afternoon, many Colombians have “onces”: coffee with pandebono, almojábana or buñuelo. At “onces” you still say Good afternoon. Good evening starts when the sun goes down, around six o'clock."
